<title>HONG KONG: Ng Fung Hong says exec director resigned.</title>
<headline>Ng Fung Hong says exec director resigned.</headline>
<dateline>HONG KONG 1996-09-30</dateline>
<text>
<p>Live and frozen foodstuffs distributor Ng Fung Hong Ltd said on Monday that Shen Geng Bao had resigned as executive director of the company with effect from September 20.</p>
<p>The company said Shen resigned from the position becasue he would retire very soon but gave no further details.</p>
<p>Ng Fung Hong is controlled by China-backed China Resources Holdings, which is the parent of China Resources Enterprise.</p>
<p>-- Hong Kong Newsroom (852) 2843 6370</p>
</text>
